type: software
title: "Catalyst Activity Prediction using Machine Learning"
abstract: >
  A machine learning web application built with Streamlit for predicting
  catalyst activity based on various chemical descriptors. This tool uses
  physicochemical properties to predict catalytic performance, enabling
  faster materials discovery and process optimization.
